Note on Commercial Edition:

This software is the Community Edition of Base AP. A separate Commercial /
Enterprise Edition exists with additional features (including but not limited
to: AI integration, task scheduling, SSO authentication, advanced audit
reporting) which is distributed under a separate commercial license and is
NOT covered by this MIT License.

The Community Edition includes a License Manager (app/core/license.py) whose
implementation is fully open; however, a valid license key signed by the
copyright holder is required to unlock commercial features in installations
that choose to use the Enterprise Edition.
